0	section	First talk
1	line	Shamus	Ay yer big elephant! Yer've caught me, to be sure! What would an elephant like yer be wanting wid ol' Shamus then?
1	line	Player	I want to find Zanaris.
1	line	Shamus	Zanaris is it now? Well well well... Yer'll be needing to be going to that funny little shed out there in the swamp, so you will.
1	line	Player	...but... I thought... Zanaris was a city...?
1	line	Shamus	Aye that it is!
1	select	Select an option
1	option	How does it fit in a shed then?
2	line	Player	...How does it fit in a shed then?
2	line	Shamus	Ah yer stupid elephant! The city isn't IN the shed! The doorway to the shed is being a portal to Zanaris, so it is.
2	line	Player	So I just walk into the shed and end up in Zanaris then?
2	line	Shamus	Oh, was I fergetting to say? Yer need to be carrying a Dramenwood staff to be getting there! Otherwise Yer'll just be ending up in the shed.
2	line	Player	So where would I get a staff?
2	line	Shamus	Dramenwood staffs are crafted from branches of the Dramen tree, so they are. I hear there's a Dramen tree over on the island of Entrana in a cave
2	line	Shamus	or some such. There would probably be a good place for an elephant like yer to be starting looking I reckon.
2	line	Shamus	The monks are running a ship from Port Sarim to Entrana, I hear too. Now leave me alone yer elephant!
2	box	The leprechaun magically disappears.
2	action	end
